-- Phase 27: settlement_model_change_requests (SPEC core 5: a vendor asks, a Super Admin decides
-- the request as asked) and ad_purchases (SPEC core 8: the vendor's own agreement, the only thing
-- that can make a promotion sponsored). home_promotions_ad_purchase_pending_check, which stood in
-- for the missing table, gives way to the foreign key. Generated by drizzle-kit; the two triggers
-- at the end are hand-added. Both enum types are created here (CREATE TYPE, not ADD VALUE), so
-- their values can be used in this same migration.
CREATE TYPE "public"."ad_purchase_status" AS ENUM('ACTIVE', 'PAUSED', 'ENDED', 'CANCELLED');--> statement-breakpoint
